   "evidence": "Grep finds no use of `mem_orderSubmodule_iff` inside Basic.lean; its only callers are Topology.lean:208 and HahnModule.lean:56, so the move is safe. `herr`'s proof matches lines 453-459 with `ofLoop_tmul` replaced by `LinearMap.rTensor_tmul`.",
