   "fix": "Move the theorem after `ofLoop_trunc_sub_mem_orderSubmodule`. Prove `trunc R L N u = 0` via `(LoopAlgebra.toFinsupp R \u2124 L).injective` and `toFinsupp_trunc`, then close with `simpa [ht] using (orderSubmodule R L N).neg_mem (ofLoop_trunc_sub_mem_orderSubmodule R L N u)`.",
   "issue": "`mem_orderSubmodule_iff` sits before the lemmas it needs and duplicates them inline: `hcoeff` re-proves `toFinsupp_trunc` (line 440), `ht` repeats the step in `trunc_eq_zero_of_mem_orderSubmodule` (line 487), `let i` rebuilds the `toLaurentSeries` hom inside `ofLoop` (line 407), and `herr` copies `ofLoop_trunc_sub_mem_orderSubmodule` (line 451) line for line.",
