  {
   "evidence": "Mathlib/Algebra/MonoidAlgebra/Module.lean:189-190 defines `basis` with `repr := coeffLinearEquiv _`, and grep for `basis_repr`/`coeffLinearEquiv_apply` finds no lemma stating the coordinate equality.",
   "file": "TauCeti/Algebra/Lie/Current/Basic.lean",
   "fix": "Removed by the restructuring above, since `toFinsupp_trunc` already gives the coordinates. Otherwise replace the `change` with an explicit lemma for `(AddMonoidAlgebra.basis \u2124 R).repr p n = p.coeff n`.",
